5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"We need to be extremely careful with the budget this year. To avoid any financial surprises, I suggest we prioritize cost predictability and actual spending records before deciding on a destination.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"Budget is important, but we should also consider the administrative burden. If the arrangements are too complex, it will overwhelm the organizers. We need to ensure the workload is manageable for everyone involved.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I agree with both of you, but we must also consider the social dynamic. The gap between year-groups is widening. We need a destination that encourages interaction and shared living to rebuild our club's cohesion.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree with all of you. However, we should also ensure the environment allows for proper rest. If the members are exhausted, the quality of our training will suffer regardless of the budget or cohesion.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I agree with the need for predictability. However, we must also consider how costs are distributed and handled if members cancel. I want to ensure the financial burden doesn't fall unfairly on a few people.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio @Asuka, since we are all concerned about costs and workload, let's divide the research. I'll focus on the actual spending and pricing structures to ensure we don't have any hidden deficits this time.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,That sounds reasonable. I will look into the administrative side to see how much effort is required for bookings and the actual duties during the camp. We cannot afford to burn out the organizers again.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minako,,"To ensure we address the social divide, I will look into how different year-groups have interacted in the past and what the seniors think about mixing them. We need a setup that forces us to bond.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I will look into the attendance sheets for the away camps and the accounts from two clubs that went inland. I want to understand the actual experience and conditions members faced.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,I will look into the quoting terms for whole-building lets and the prefecture rate sheet for publicly run beds. I want to see which options offer the most stable pricing regardless of the final headcount.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Since we've identified our priorities, let's finalize the list. I will look into the group transport receipts from the last three years and the lottery and application process for public group bookings.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"I will look into the canteen closure and last year's cooking duty, as well as the vacation timetable for the club's own hall. This will help me assess the actual labor required on-site.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will look into what the seniors say about year-groups mixing and the attendance sheets for the away camps. I want to see who actually shows up and how we can better integrate everyone.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"Actually, @Minako, since you are taking the attendance sheets, I will look into the accounts from two clubs that went inland and the membership list against first-train times to see how travel affects their energy.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I'll stick with the quoting terms for whole-building lets and the prefecture rate sheet for publicly run beds. I need to confirm if flat fees are truly the most equitable way to handle our budget.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,It seems we have a comprehensive plan. I will handle the transport receipts and the public booking lottery. Let's ensure we all report our findings clearly in the next round to avoid any miscalculations.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"Agreed. I will focus on the labor and facility availability. Let's make sure we evaluate the options not just by cost, but by the actual time and effort they demand from us.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Minako,,I will focus on the social dynamics and attendance patterns. Let's keep in mind that the physical layout of our destination will be key to breaking down the barriers between the year-groups.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will focus on the inland club accounts and the first-train times. I hope this data helps us choose a place where everyone can truly recharge and perform their best.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Asuka,,Everything is set. I will investigate the whole-building let terms and the public bed rate sheets. I expect to find a way to minimize the financial risk associated with last-minute cancellations.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
